  "scope": "0.10.1-claudegpt.21: stage 2 slice 2 of the Rust migration. Additive PTY host protocol services (welcome services quota=1, clients=1, launch=1 beside transcripts=1, no protocol bump); rust/reframe-services ports coordinatorExecutable/readCodexQuota (execFile timeout 20 s with kill, 64 MiB output limit), userHasStatusLine, adoptedClient (BOM skipped, sha256 cached by path/size/mtime) and evaluateLaunchConfig (no unsafe); the Rust host serves quota.codex/statusLine, clients.adopted and launch.evaluate on worker threads (at most 8 per service, no host timers); the Node host serves the same with the TypeScript modules; conformance fixtures (adoption records with/without BOM, missing, corrupt, other schema, hash mismatch, launch-config variants, status-line settings, a fake Coordinator example exe) run against both hosts; Electron asks the host when advertised and reads in-process otherwise or on failure; the launch config stays in-process at startup (before any host)",
